For an integer matrix $A\in \Z^{m\times n}$, we define 
\begin{equation}
\begin{aligned}
  \Delta_A &:= \max \{|\det(B)|: B \text{ is a  nonsingular submatrix of } A\},\mbox{ and}\\
  \dot\Delta_A &:=\lcm \{|\det(B)|: B \text{ is a nonsingular submatrix of } A\}.\\
  \end{aligned}
\end{equation} 
